            "review_title": "Review at Cello Xua Cafe & Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Cyril T\nShelburne, Canada150 contributions\n0\nCasual, cheap and pleasant\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nThis restaurant was close to our condo so we started by stopping in for a cheap, cheap beer. The bathrooms were spotless so we started ordering a bit of food. Nothing fancy but the Pho is good, both Spring rolls, fresh and deep fried are good. We had breakfast... just kind of grew on us. The price is cheap! Cheap! Cheap! Service is good, girls are sweet and pleasant.\nRead more\nWritten February 21, 2018",
