            "review_text": "plikaraisk\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nGood place for drinks, not for food.\nMay 2017 • Friends\nBeer and juices are good. The service quick and friendly, but stay away from pasta carbonara. We have ordered it twice and both times it has been extremely sweet. They used condensed milk to make the sauce! We told them, that this sauce is wrong, you cannot use condensed milk to make salty dish, but obviously they didn´t understand or didn´t tell it to the chef. The penne was just right, cooked al dente, but yes, lost in translation.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 5, 2017",
