            "review_text": "Stanley\nDubai, United Arab Emirates9 contributions\n1\nbest taste and quite location in nha trang\nApr 2017 • Couples\nbeen there several times during my time in nha trang. beer was ice cold. didn't see any rats at all.\nstaff very friendly and capable of speaking perfectly fine english (remember, this is Vietnam!).\nyou can choose between three pre-selected menus (incl. one veggie) or just do the usual a la card style. price range from 'viet-cheap' to 'cheap', depending on what you pick:\nfried rice with beef/shrimp/squid/... , good amount, about 2 eur/usd.\nI recommend the pineapple-boat with rice, about 4 eur/usd, which was very good.\nca phe sua da (icecoffee with sweetened condensed milk) also very good and cheap.\n\nthey also serve western stuff. burgers, French fries instead of rice etc....\nhot pots are about 5 eur/usd which is very very cheap for nha trang. (dunno if its worth it, I didn't try it at cello xua yet)\n\nlessons clear: nice cozy place, good prices, good food, good drinks, slightly away from all the russian trouble near the oceanside. I highly recommend this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 29, 2017",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
